Tue Oct 27 21:00:00 UTC 2026 - Rok Krajnc <rok.krajnc@gmail.com>

- Initial package, version 0.1.0:
  * Phone calls over Bluetooth through PipeWire's telephony API,
    with a dialer, call notifications and the call audio on the
    computer
  * The phone's screen, apps and camera in windows with scrcpy,
    apps in the application menu, the camera as a webcam
